                <pb facs="0106" n="10" sameAs="frus:frus1900/pg10"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Wilde to Mr.
                            Hay</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the Argentine Republic</hi>,<lb/><hi
                                rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1900-06-18"><hi rendition="#italic">June 18,
                                1900</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Mr. Secretary of State</hi>: I have the honor to lay
                    before your excellency, for such use as may be proper, the information that the
                    Argentine school-ship <hi rendition="#italic">Presidente Sdrmiento</hi> is to
                    arrive shortly in the port of New York and wishes to present her corps of
                    officers to the Most Excellent President of the United States of America and
                    your excellency, and to the Secretary of the Navy, as I had the honor orally to
                    inform your excellency.</p>
                <p>I renew, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">E. Wilde</hi>.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
